<title>ITALY: Italy cabinet to meet Tuesday on budget passage.</title>
<headline>Italy cabinet to meet Tuesday on budget passage.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's cabinet will meet at 0930 GMT on Tuesday to discuss the 1997 budget's passage through parliament, an official statement said. It did not elaborate.</p>
<p>The package has been approved by the lower Chamber of Deputies and is now working its way through the Senate, where amendments will mean it must return to the lower house for a further reading.</p>
<p>The budget, designed to reduce next year's deficit by 62.5 trillion lire, has to be approved by the end of the year under Italian law.</p>
<p>--Rome newsroom +39 6 678 2505</p>
</text>
